{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742370/extras/7eaf4f83beaeb3b3aa783a7de2389848.avif?t=1767203104\" width=1420 height=277 /></span><strong>Why... Continue?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instinct</strong> is a <strong>die &amp; retry</strong> game with organic 2D pixel art where speedrun-oriented mechanics such as dashing, sliding, and parrying blend seamlessly between combat and platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 increasingly intense chapters </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondary paths for the most daring </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An organic pixel art style accompanied by a sublime original score </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wealth of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>My condolences, Hero of the Imak Laws...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-war world, you play as Agent <strong>Ichiyo</strong>, recently enlisted in the resistance against the government.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through levels with <strong>evolving mechanics</strong> interspersed with <strong>narrative sequences</strong> that reveal <strong>a universe more detailed than it first appears</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glory to the Resistance.<br>Glory to <strong>Imak</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1742370?t=1767203104","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742370/20820d4011dcd1751d78aed01a407f35d3204c38/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767203104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/17423